        {
          "text": "Wakavuwa kuti, Kwiinka ncobeni tulainka ayebo, nekubaboobo olu lweendo ndotola talukooyookuletela bulemu pe, nkaambo Jehova ulaaba Sisera mumaanza aamwanakazi. Mpawo Debora wakabuka, wakasindikila Baraki kuya ku-Kedesi. ",
