                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino Sisera wakacija amaulu kuya kucilao ca-Jaeli muka-Heberi muKeni, nkaambo kakuli lumvwanano akati ka-Jabini mwami wa-Hazori aluzubo lwa-Heberi mu-Keni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela jaeli wakazwa kuvootambula Sisera, wakamwaambila kuti Njila, mwami, njila mulindime, utayoowi pe, Mpawo wakanjila mulinguwe mucilao, nkabela wakamuvumbya isalu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.5.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bab 5:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo wakamukumbila kuti, Undinywisye twaanzi, nkaambo ndafwa nyota, Mpawo wakasinkula insuwa yamalili, wakamunywisya akumuvumba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino wakamwaambila kuti, Ima kumulyango wacilao, elyo na kusike muntu uubuzya kuti, Sa muli muntu? ulamwaambila kuti, Taakwe pe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
