        },
        {
          "text": "Lino Baraki naakacili kuya butobela Sisera, jaeli wakazwa kuyoomucinga, wakati, Koza, ndakutondezya oyo muntu ngoyandaula. Elyo wakanjila mulinguwe, wakajana Sisera ulilede ansi, ulifwide, anembe mumpobe zyakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
