              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ijanza lyabana ba-Israyeli lyakali kuya bulemena Jabini mwami wa-Kanana, mane bakanyonyoona oyo Jabini mwami wa-Kanana.",
          "type": "text",
